      "writtenOn": "2023-06-07T08:31:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, thank you. I will do it in next patchset.\n\nPlease let me explain why this is needed.\n\n**About force_reset and force_ipa:**\nI have added a vh in android13-5.15, it does the same thing of this patch. link:\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2050135.\nBut it complicates the conditional statement.\nIn order to make it concise, we just add the flag of enable/reset and use goto logic, but do condition judgment in my driver.\n\n**About update:**\nWhen the user power budget is changed from non-zero to zero, the ipa should be reset even if temperature \u003c switch_on_temp, and force_reset should be true.\nWhile at this time, if the ```update \u003d (tz-\u003elast_temperature \u003e\u003d switch_on_temp); ```update flag would always be false, it can not be reset which means the state of cooling devices can not be reset. At the same time, the allow_maximum_power() and __thermal_cdev_update() are not exported, it is not able to do reset in my driver. So this update flag is needed too.",
